onary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸이","audio":"/audio/5a8fb4d5acf8e6fe3214.mp3"}},{"text":"개운해지더라고.","meaning":"爽快，轻松；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"개운하다：爽快，轻松；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"개운하다","audio":"/audio/0c4853cb02b40494e5d9.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26673","senseId":"1","lemma":"개운하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개운해지더라고","audio":"/audio/960ef8609ba1a953cd90.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"2ab06103292c5d65","term":"피부","zh":"皮肤","audio":"/audio/2ab06103292c5d650d25.mp3","entryId":"66308","definition":"覆盖人或动物身体表面的组织。","pronunciation":["피부"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"0c4853cb02b40494","term":"개운하다","zh":"爽快，轻松","audio":"/audio/0c4853cb02b40494e5d9.mp3","entryId":"26673","definition":"心情或身体感到清爽和轻快。","pronunciation":["개운하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c637e16d80f4a11f083c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.076,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68637","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","licens